OL,3,AJudge asks Orange Order to postpone
OL,4,ADrumcree parade as she urges parties to
OL,5,A'step back from the abyss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge hearing the legal challenge to
OL,8,Fthe Parades Commission's decision to
OL,9,Fallow the Orange Order to march along
OL,10,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown has
OL,11,Fgiven the parties involved a final
OL,12,Fopportunity to "reach an agreement" and
OL,13,F"step back from the abyss".
OL,15,FFollowing an adjournment Judge Patricia
OL,16,FSmyth requested that Portadown District
OL,17,FOrange Lodge are contacted to find out
OL,18,Fwhether they would be prepared to
OL,19,Ftemporarily halt the parade to allow a
OL,20,Ffull hearing to take place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
