OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJudge asks Orange Order to postpone
OL,4,ADrumcree parade as she urges parties to
OL,5,A'step back from the abyss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe commission on Friday announced that
OL,8,Fthe parade can proceed on Sunday, for
OL,9,Fthe first time in almost 30 years, with
OL,10,Frestrictions in place.
OL,12,FThe coalition has also applied to the
OL,13,FParades Commission for a protest to the
OL,14,Fwalk on Sunday, listing the number of
OL,15,Fparticipants at 5,000. A decision is
OL,16,Fexpected on Saturday, according to the
OL,17,Fcommission.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
